    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553-a7">

                <pb facs="0926" n="856" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg856"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stevens to Dr.
                            Pflaum.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Axar.</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1883-05-02T23:59:59+01:56"
                            notBefore="1883-04-30T00:00:00+01:34"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>The governor-general has given the necessary orders. I will do all in my power to
                    see that justice is done.</p>
                <closer><signed>STEVENS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
